    "title_en": "Unorientable supersymmetric compactifications of M-theory",
    "abstract_en": "We discuss orbifold compactifications of the type II string, where the orbifold combines a free action on a base manifold and the $(-1)^{\\boldsymbol{F}_{\\text{L}}}$ symmetry which acts by -1 on left-moving Ramond sectors. Such backgrounds can preserve minimal supersymmetry and lift to M-theory compactification on smooth unorientable manifolds.",
